[[7,1,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before working on the airbag system,\nthe following preliminary operations must be carried out: (1) place\nthe ignition key in the OFF position and extract it;  (2) disconnect\nthe battery terminals and insulate them; (3) wait for at least 10 minutes\nbefore continuing.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (see assembly 5508C - AIR BAG SYSTEM)</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before removing the steering wheel,\nplace the wheels as parallel as possible to the longitudinal axis\nof the vehicle.</p></aside><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p>Remove the compartment as described in\nthe procedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p>1. Remove the trims using a suitable tool.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047149.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection and release the ignition\nswitch wiring from the fastenings.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047150.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the dashboard trim.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take great care not to damage\nthe vehicle fittings and the electrical wiring when removing the\ndashboard trim.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047151.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the dashboard trim.</p><p>Tighten the bolts.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take great care not to damage\nthe vehicle fittings and the electrical wiring when positioning\nthe dashboard trim.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Connect the electrical connection and secure\nthe ignition switch wiring.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Ignition switch</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>H1A</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Place the trims in position.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753181\">7040A17</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752873\">5020B22</a>\n                                           (All)</p><p><a href=\"#/2753189\">7040A56</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753190\">7040A72</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753191\">7040A78</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753010\">5580C22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752851\">5010C14</a>\n                                           (Both)</p><p>Fit the compartment as described in the\nprocedure:</p><p><a href=\"#/2753182\">7040A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753011\">5580C26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753188\">7040A37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753185\">7040A28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752995\">5560B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753183\">7040A23</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752983\">5550A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753184\">7040A26</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752777\">4110A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753009\">5580C18</a></p><p>Connect the battery terminals.</p><p>Check the operation of the Air Bag system\nusing the Examiner or other diagnostic equipment.</p>"]]